    "note": "Initial Verus versions lacked sufficient arithmetic lemmas / failed postconditions. Corrected final production body passes. Logs are development evidence, not passing proofs. Initial metadata smoke used a binary before authenticated_span integration; final smoke and 100 GB run share the final binary.",
    "integration_initial_run": "760 passed; one existing test still required adaptive <=512 metadata. Updated it to assert fixed 1024-byte granularity with 4096 digests and preserve streamed write/read coverage; full suite rerun.",
